note Target admission for omega_cubin_pack_target. The C caller passes a present flag
note (1 when the parameter pointer is non-null) and copies the message. Pointer I/O stays in C.
note Refusal 8 is OMEGA_CUBIN_E_TARGET. Refusal 1 is OMEGA_CUBIN_E_ARG.
note unsupported cubin target sm_
fn ca0 o edit uchar 64 p ulong to ulong
put o add p 0 uchar 117
put o add p 1 uchar 110
put o add p 2 uchar 115
put o add p 3 uchar 117
put o add p 4 uchar 112
put o add p 5 uchar 112
put o add p 6 uchar 111
put o add p 7 uchar 114
put o add p 8 uchar 116
put o add p 9 uchar 101
put o add p 10 uchar 100
put o add p 11 uchar 32
put o add p 12 uchar 99
put o add p 13 uchar 117
put o add p 14 uchar 98
put o add p 15 uchar 105
put o add p 16 uchar 110
put o add p 17 uchar 32
put o add p 18 uchar 116
put o add p 19 uchar 97
put o add p 20 uchar 114
put o add p 21 uchar 103
put o add p 22 uchar 101
put o add p 23 uchar 116
put o add p 24 uchar 32
put o add p 25 uchar 115
put o add p 26 uchar 109
put o add p 27 uchar 95
ret add p 28
end
note null parameter array
fn ca1 o edit uchar 64 p ulong to ulong
put o add p 0 uchar 110
put o add p 1 uchar 117
put o add p 2 uchar 108
put o add p 3 uchar 108
put o add p 4 uchar 32
put o add p 5 uchar 112
put o add p 6 uchar 97
put o add p 7 uchar 114
put o add p 8 uchar 97
put o add p 9 uchar 109
put o add p 10 uchar 101
put o add p 11 uchar 116
put o add p 12 uchar 101
put o add p 13 uchar 114
put o add p 14 uchar 32
put o add p 15 uchar 97
put o add p 16 uchar 114
put o add p 17 uchar 114
put o add p 18 uchar 97
put o add p 19 uchar 121
ret add p 20
end
note decimal target, copied after the prefix. omnum writes at offset 0 of its own buffer.
fn cadec sm ulong msg edit uchar 64 p ulong to ulong
tmp = new uchar 24 0
n = omnum sm 10 0 tmp
for i ulong n
put msg add p i get tmp i
end
ret add p n
end
fn cubadmit sm ulong np ulong present ulong msg edit uchar 64 to uint
p = ulong 0
if and ne sm 86 ne sm 121
p = ca0 msg 0
p = cadec sm msg p
put msg p 0
ret 8
end
if and ne np 0 eq present 0
p = ca1 msg 0
put msg p 0
ret 1
end
put msg 0 0
ret 0
end
